From 10ca3c52423367164009c86dfbd2f3e9d755216e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 21:11:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: char create supports goblin and worgen (F-219)

- races 9 Goblin (Horde) and 12 Worgen (Alliance) parse by name or id
- charcatalog: --source/--races/--out/--var build an extra catalogue from a server's own
  CharSections/CharHairGeosets/CharacterFacialHairStyles DBCs + playercreateinfo
- pkg/char/profiles_zeppelin_gen.go: 16 race/class pairs, 8 appearance profiles generated
  from Zeppelin data/dbc and acore_world playercreateinfo (races 9,12)
- resolve() merges the stock and Zeppelin catalogues; tests updated

Regenerate: ./run charcatalog:generate --source tmp/zeppelin-data --races 9,12
  --out pkg/char/profiles_zeppelin_gen.go --var zeppelinCatalogue

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
